1
00:00:00,579 --> 00:00:01,789
(Leonard:)We're going to Long Beach?

2
00:00:01,956 --> 00:00:04,796
(Sheldon:)Of course not, there's no cousin Leo,
there's no intervention.

3
00:00:04,959 --> 00:00:07,589
(Sheldon:)- Focus, Leonard.
- Oh, come on.

4
00:00:08,462 --> 00:00:11,752
(Sheldon:)We just leave the house on Friday night
and return in the wee hours...

5
00:00:11,924 --> 00:00:15,674
(Sheldon:)...emotionally wrung out from the work
of convincing Leo to go back into rehab.

6
00:00:15,844 --> 00:00:17,344
(Leonard:)So he goes back into rehab?

7
00:00:17,513 --> 00:00:22,763
(Sheldon:)Yes, but he can relapse if Penny
ever invites us to hear her sing again.

8
00:00:24,353 --> 00:00:25,813
(Leonard:)You still told her I lied.

9
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,270
Yeah, for a noble purpose.

10
00:00:27,439 --> 00:00:31,189
(Sheldon:)To spare me the social embarrassment
of having a drug-addled first cousin.

11
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:34,110
(Sheldon:)- Which I'm assuming is embarrassing, yes?
- I don't know.

12
00:00:35,656 --> 00:00:39,446
- How am I supposed to remember all this?
- That's the best part, you don't have to.

13
00:00:39,618 --> 00:00:43,618
(Sheldon:)I told Penny that you would be embarrassed
if you knew she found out you had lied...

14
00:00:43,789 --> 00:00:47,669
(Sheldon:)...so she's agreed to operate
as if the original lie is still in force.

15
00:00:50,337 --> 00:00:55,297
(Leonard:)So she's expecting me to lie
about going to a symposium in Pasadena...

16
00:00:55,467 --> 00:01:00,467
(Leonard:)...when in actuality, we're pretending to go
to a drug intervention in Long Beach.

